## Manual Test

1. Launch app
2. Run: `curl http://localhost:7779/health`
3. Should return: {"status": "healthy", "active_sessions": 0}
4. Quit app
5. Run curl again - should fail (connection refused)

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] Server starts automatically on app launch
- [ ] Server responds to health check after launch
- [ ] Server stops cleanly on app termination
- [ ] No crashes or hangs on quit
